      "name": "Bottom Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-bar",
      "description": "Five labelled destinations; active icon in a tonal pill; centre Log is a violet pill that opens the log sheet.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a class=\"ds-nav-i on\"><span class=\"ds-pill\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"5\"/><path d=\"M12 1v2M12 21v2M4.2 4.2l1.4 1.4M18.4 18.4l1.4 1.4M1 12h2M21 12h2M4.2 19.8l1.4-1.4M18.4 5.6l1.4-1.4\"/></svg></span>Today</a><a class=\"ds-nav-i\"><span class=\"ds-pill\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"/></svg></span>Quests</a><a class=\"ds-nav-i log\"><span class=\"ds-pill\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></span>Log</a><a class=\"ds-nav-i\"><span class=\"ds-pill\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg></span>Arena</a><a class=\"ds-nav-i\"><span class=\"ds-pill\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/></svg></span>Status</a></nav>",
